# 31. SEARCH AND PAGINATION

Backend document search supports more functionality than the Flutter client currently uses.

Do not assume the current client search represents all backend capabilities.

KNOWN RISK:

Backend pagination may apply SQL LIMIT/OFFSET before relationship-based visibility filtering for non-admin users.

This can cause visible documents to be omitted.

Before modifying pagination:

- inspect SQL query order
- inspect relationship filtering
- inspect source-row merging
- inspect final slicing
- test non-admin users

Do not solve missing results merely by increasing the frontend limit.

